cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CapacityEquilibriaBenchmarks.jl"
abstract: >-
  Murphy and Smeers' capacity-expansion equilibria on constructed instances whose answers
  are known independently of any solver, built as complementarity problems solved with PATH
  and as MPCCs for CCOpt.jl, with test cases offered to CCOpt.jl. The paper publishes no
  numerical example, so no number here is its authors'.
type: software
authors:
